			id: "443C87F8C0DF9B0D"
			title: "The Charm Slot"
			description: ["A Tome does nothing in your hotbar. Open the Trinkets screen and", "put it in the charm / Spell Book slot.", "", "Only then do your wand, staff or sword cast from it. The slot is", "keep-on-death, so the Tome survives when the rest of you does not."]
