			id: "F1E5FA73EEFC173E"
			title: "Lost And Found"
			description: ["Lost Trinkets unlock at random from ordinary play: mining ore,", "farming, chopping, trading, killing. Bosses are 1 in 10.", "", "They live in their own screen, not your inventory -- bind", "'Open Trinkets GUI'. You start with one slot; the next costs", "15 experience levels, and 3 more for each after that."]
